"Your bank charges you between 0.60 % and 1.80 % per transaction,\n"
"                            plus terminal rental, plus fixed fees.\n"
"                            EXOCOMS offers you a transparent card payment contract:\n"
"                            a flat rate of 0.25 %, terminal included, with no need to change banks."
msgstr ""
"Votre banque vous facture entre 0,60 % et 1,80 % par transaction,\n"
"                            plus la location du terminal, plus des frais fixes.\n"
